<CodeBlock code={_shikiCode2} lang="typescript" />

<h2>Dashboard integration</h2>
<CodeBlock code={_shikiCode3} lang="typescript" />

<h2>Periodic health check</h2>
<CodeBlock code={_shikiCode4} lang="typescript" />

<div class="callout callout-info">
  <div class="callout-icon">ℹ️</div>
  <div class="callout-content">
    <div class="callout-title">Zero cost without the plugin</div>
    <p>The core never increments any counters unless <code>MetricsPlugin</code> is installed. If you don't need retry metrics, omit the plugin and pay no overhead.</p>
  </div>
</div>

